# Bulk source media only — regenerate via `scripts/run_pipeline.py ingest`, not meant to live in
# git history. Everything else under data/ (manifest.jsonl, text descriptions, cached .npy
# embeddings) and all of artifacts/ (trained projection head + FAISS indices) IS tracked
# deliberately: all small, and committing them is what lets Colab-trained results reach the
# local Streamlit app via `git pull` instead of Google Drive.
